you were on our show --

00:00:30.296 --> 00:00:32.165
I don't know
if you remember this --

00:00:32.165 --> 00:00:33.632
This was is in --
-Yes.

00:00:33.632 --> 00:00:35.702
-This was in Puerto Rico.

00:00:35.702 --> 00:00:37.837
-In Puerto Rico
with Jose Feliciano.

00:00:37.837 --> 00:00:41.508
-Jose Feliciano, that's right!
You remember!

00:00:41.508 --> 00:00:43.976
Yeah, that was the biggest --
-I remember.

00:00:43.976 --> 00:00:46.579
-Was that the --
Have you worked with him before?

00:00:46.579 --> 00:00:49.415
-That's the first time
I've seen Jose Feliciano.

00:00:49.415 --> 00:00:50.850
-Yeah, he's really funny.

00:00:50.850 --> 00:00:52.819
He loves jokes
and fooling around.

00:00:52.819 --> 00:00:55.788
-Yeah, but the first time
