00:01:24.183 --> 00:01:26.652
I want to see it.
I want to see it.

00:01:26.652 --> 00:01:28.621
If you get a chance --

00:01:28.621 --> 00:01:32.825
Talk about an amazing
performer -- Ozuna always.

00:01:32.825 --> 00:01:35.494
You know, I was checking out, I
was doing some research on you.

00:01:35.494 --> 00:01:39.064
On the Internet, your videos,

00:01:39.064 --> 00:01:42.302
nine of your videos are
over one billion on YouTube.

00:01:42.302 --> 00:01:44.804
Billion by the way, not million.

00:01:44.804 --> 00:01:47.674
[ Cheers and applause ]
Billion.

00:01:47.674 --> 00:01:53.846
Including "Taki Taki,"
which is over two billion.

00:01:53.846 --> 00:01:55.781
And I tried to research this.

00:01:55.781 --> 00:01:58.150
And maybe I'm wrong,
but does it mean anything?

00:01:58.150 --> 00:02:01.353
What does "taki taki" mean?
[ Laughter ]

00:02:01.353 --> 00:02:04.590
-Well, I don't know
what's "taki taki."

00:02:04.590 --> 00:02:07.927
[ Laughter ]
-Thank you.

00:02:07.927 --> 00:02:10.129
Well, what is it?

00:02:10.129 --> 00:02:11.897
-I don't know what it is.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:11.897 --> 00:02:15.835
They call me -- They call me
and send me the beats.

00:02:15.835 --> 00:02:18.270
That's when I got
the show in Mexico.

00:02:18.270 --> 00:02:22.041
I remember, and he say,
"Yo, I need this song for today.

00:02:22.041 --> 00:02:23.175
I need something.

00:02:23.175 --> 00:02:26.545
I need the first 50 seconds,
45 seconds.

00:02:26.545 --> 00:02:29.381
And I want to do songs
featuring around the world."

00:02:29.381 --> 00:02:33.252
And I got one hour.
I got show, so let's do it hot.

00:02:33.252 --> 00:02:36.122
I got to call my engineer
and say, "Yo, let's do it."

00:02:36.122 --> 00:02:40.659
And when I practiced
with the melody of the song,

00:02:40.659 --> 00:02:42.127
and I say "taki taki."

00:02:42.127 --> 00:02:45.164
[ Singing in Spanish ]

00:02:45.164 --> 00:02:49.369
But that's the -- you know,
the melody got the instrumental.

00:02:49.369 --> 00:02:54.140
So, I sent the next night back
and he called me one week --

00:02:54.140 --> 00:02:55.808
the next one week, he say to me,

00:02:55.808 --> 00:02:58.243
"Yo, I got the best feature
with Cardi B.

00:02:58.243 --> 00:03:01.680
But I got one surprise for you.
Come to the video."

00:03:01.680 --> 00:03:03.349
It's the next month.

00:03:03.349 --> 00:03:05.318
I go to the video,
and I see Selena Gomez.

00:03:05.318 --> 00:03:07.853
So I say, "Yo, you got
the best surprise for me,"

00:03:07.853 --> 00:03:10.189
because I didn't know
Selena Gomez was in this at all.

00:03:10.189 --> 00:03:12.358
-Yeah, and you're like,
"I don't even care if taki taki

00:03:12.358 --> 00:03:13.859
doesn't mean anything.
This is going to be a hit!"

00:03:13.859 --> 00:03:15.028
-I don't know
what's "taki taki."

00:03:15.028 --> 00:03:16.496
Everybody says,
"Yo, what is 'taki taki?'"

00:03:16.496 --> 00:03:17.830
I don't know
what is "taki taki."

00:03:17.830 --> 00:03:20.032
